Defining interfaces with default
implementations
A language feature introduced in C# 8.0 is default implementations for an interface.
1. In the PacktLibrary project, add a new file named IPlayable.cs. If you
have installed C# Extensions, then you can right-click the PacktLibrary
folder and choose Add C# Interface.
